CachyOS native-build changes for dwproton

dwproton-11.0-16 is based on CachyOS's cachyos-11.0-20261015-slr tag (the
"upstream" branch of https://dawn.wine/dawn-winery/dwproton). This patch adds
the commits that turn that tag into cachyos-11.0-20261015-native. It was made
in https://github.com/CachyOS/proton-cachyos with:

  git diff cachyos-11.0-20261015-slr cachyos-11.0-20261015-native

It holds these CachyOS commits:
  86f98f60 Partially revert "Makefile.in: Hack around Sniper + GCC 14 quirks."
  cd019d95 build: build proton without SteamLinuxRuntime
  aa078cc4 build: fix piper library install path
  6a6f2520 proton: clean environment from Steam runtime (scout)
  227349f4 proton: do not list this tool in Steam

On dwproton-11.0-16, the result is the same tree as a merge of
cachyos-11.0-20261015-native.

